# A SAL project that materializes RDF from the sample SAL module published at
# https://github.com/adplincinst/sample-salmodule-1
#
# Building this file clones that repository, builds the Dockerfile in its root,
# runs the module with the task instance declared below, and merges the U.S.
# state reference features the module emits into the built triples.

@prefix salmodule: <https://w3id.org/sal/cgs-earth/sal-module-spec/salmodule#> .
@prefix states: <salmodule://github.com/adplincinst/sample-salmodule-1/> .

# The module's own ontology declares GeoconnexReferenceFeatureStates as a
# subclass of salmodule:Task, which is how SAL knows this instance is runnable.
# maxRetries is likewise defined by the module, so the module decides what a
# valid task instance looks like.
<GeoconnexStates> a states:GeoconnexReferenceFeatureStates ;
    salmodule:taskInstanceEnvVar '{"@id":"https://github.com/adplincinst/sample-salmodule-1/GeoconnexStates","@type":"GeoconnexReferenceFeatureStates","maxRetries":{"@value":"5","@type":"xsd:integer"}}' .
